          "sequence": 14,
          "arabic_text": "وَبِاسْمِكَ الَّذِي يَصْلُحُ بِهِ الْأَوَّلُونَ وَالْآخِرُونَ",
          "transliteration": "wa bismika alladhī yaṣluḥu bihī al-awwalūna wal-ākhirūna",
          "english_text": "and in Your Name with which the past and the coming generations have become upright!",
